##api

##1.Admin

###1.1 Admin Signup
GET http://localhost:9092/admin/auth/register-admin
content-type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "",
  "email": "",
  "password": "",
  "confirmPassword": ""
}
###

###1.2 Admin Login
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/login
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": "",
  "password": "",
  "rememberMe": ""
}
###

###1.3 Admin Profile
GET http://localhost:9092/admin/me
Authorization: Bearer <paste-admin-token>
###

###1.4 Forgot Password
GET http://localhost:9092/admin/auth/forgot-password
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": ""
}
###

###1.4.1 Admin Reset Password
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/reset-password
content-type: application/json

{
  "resetPasswordToken": "",
  "password": ""
}
###

##2.User

###2.1 User Register
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/local/register
content-type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "email": "",
  "password": ""
}
###

###2.2 User Login
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/local
content-type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "",
  "password": ""
}
###

###2.3 User Profile
GET http://localhost:9092/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer <paste-user-token>
###

###2.4 User Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/forgot-password
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": ""
}
###

###2.4.1 User Reset Password
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/reset-password
content-type: application/json

{
  "code": "",
  "password": "",
  "passwordConfirmation": ""
}
###